  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 240°C/220°C fan-forced.\n• Cut sweet potato into fries.\n• Place fries on a lined oven tray. Drizzle with olive oil, season with salt and sprinkle with mixed sesame seeds.\n• Toss fries to coat, then bake until tender, 20-25 minutes. TIP: If your oven tray is getting crowded, divide the fries between two trays.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/62a03d11a56cc1cab0001fdf/step-89a522ab.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, thinly slice spring onion (see ingredients).\n• Grate carrot, then squeeze out any excess moisture with a paper towel (this will help the fritters crisp up in the pan!).\n• Finely chop garlic. Slice apple into thin sticks. Thinly slice pear (see ingredients). Roughly chop coriander.\n• Thinly slice the long chilli (if using). Drain the sweetcorn.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/62a03d11a56cc1cab0001fdf/step-c565c890.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a medium bowl, add miso paste and the egg. Mix well to combine.\n• Add carrot, sweetcorn, coriander, spring onion, garlic, chilli, the plain flour and the milk. Season, then mix well to combine. TIP: Lift out some of the mixture with a spoon. If it's too wet and doesn't hold its shape, add a little more flour!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/62a03d11a56cc1cab0001fdf/step-d240a03b.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Heat a large frying pan over a medium-high heat with enough olive oil to coat the base.\n• When the oil is hot, cook heaped tablespoons of the fritter mixture, in batches, until golden, 3-4 minutes each side (don't flip too early!).\n• Transfer to a paper towel-lined plate. TIP: Add extra oil between batches as needed.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/62a03d11a56cc1cab0001fdf/step-fb64a277.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• When the fritters are almost done, combine Japanese dressing, salad leaves, apple and pear in a medium bowl.\n• Toss to coat.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/62a03d11a56cc1cab0001fdf/step-214de969.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide miso corn fritters, Asian-style salad and sesame sweet potato fries between plates.\n• Drizzle mayonnaise over fritters to serve. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/62a03d11a56cc1cab0001fdf/step-3367b29f.jpg"
    }
  ]
}
